Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Foreign
                    Policy File, D790017–0441. Confidential; Immediate; Exdis. Drafted by Chapman;
                    cleared by Melvyn Levitsky (IO/UNP),
                        Dillery, Hopper, and Thomas Reynders (S/S–O); approved
                    by Vest. Sent for information to Ankara;
                    and Priority to Athens, Bonn, London, Ottawa, and Paris.
